        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A type of HCD characterized by the production of incomplete monoclonal mu-heavy chains without associated light chains. The clinical presentation resembles that of patients with chronic lymphocytic leukemia/small lymphocytic lymphoma (CLL/SLL).</obo:IAO_0000115>
