        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Rare non-syndromic intellectual disability is a rare, hereditary, neurologic disease characterized by early-onset cognitive impairment as a sole disability. The disease may be associated with autism, epilepsy and neuromuscular deficits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
