        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic vascular anomaly characterized by the presence of angiomatous lesions affecting the skin, brain, and spinal cord. Lesions of the central nervous system have a marked tendency to bleed. There have been no further descriptions in the literature since 1988.</obo:IAO_0000115>
