        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare imprinting disorder characterized by pre- and postnatal overgrowth, macroglossia, abdominal wall defects and an elevated tumor risk. The clinical expression is variable, ranging from lateralised overgrowth to a pronounced clinical presentation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
