        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare multiple congenital anomalies/dysmorphic syndrome characterized by brachydactyly, nystagmus, and cerebellar ataxia. Intellectual deficit and strabismus have also been reported. There have been no further descriptions in the literature since 1934.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Biemond syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Brachydactyly-nystagmus-cerebellar ataxia syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
