            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Bloom syndrome is a rare disorder associated with pre- and postnatal growth deficiency, a telangiectatic erythematous rash of the face and other sun-exposed areas, insulin resistance and predisposition to early onset and recurrent cancer of multiple organ systems.</obo:IAO_0000115>
