        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Botulism is a rare acquired neuromuscular junction disease, characterized by descending flaccid paralysis caused by botulinum neurotoxins (BoNTs), including four clinical forms with different modes of acquisition.</obo:IAO_0000115>
