        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare primary immunodeficiency characterized by persistent, debilitating and/or recurrent infections of the skin, nails, and mucus membranes, mainly with the fungal pathogen &lt;i&gt;Candida albicans&lt;/i&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
