        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Hyperkeratosis-hyperpigmentation syndrome describes a very rare hyperpigmentation of the skin characterized by tiny hyperpigmented spots mainly on skin exposed to sunlight, together with mild punctate palmoplantar papular hyperkeratosis as a major feature. There have been no further descriptions in the literature since 1993.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hyperkeratosis-hyperpigmentation syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Hyperkeratosis-hyperpigmentation syndrome</rdfs:label>
