        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, acquired uterine disease characterized by intrauterine adhesions associated with a history of curettage or intrauterine surgery and gynecological symptoms (secondary amenorrhea, hypomenorrhea, pelvic pain, infertility or pregnancy loss).</obo:IAO_0000115>
