            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A form of the peroxisomal disease X-linked adrenoleukodystrophy, characterized by progressive myelopathy and peripheral neuropathy, and often associated with peripheral adrenal insufficiency in males. Onset is typically in adulthood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
