        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare malformation syndrome characterized by the association of toe syndactyly, facial dysmorphism including telecanthus (abnormal distance between the eyes) and a broad nasal tip, urogenital malformations and anal atresia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
