        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare autosomal anomaly characterized by variable clinical features, most commonly including global developmental delay, hypotonia, growth retardation with microcephaly, intellectual disability with severe speech delay, seizures or abnormal EEG, autistic spectrum disorder and other behavioral characteristics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Ring 22</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
