        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare multiple congenital anomalies/dysmorphic syndrome characterized by the co-occurrence of Cerebral, Ocular, Dental, Auricular and Skeletal anomalies (acronym CODAS). CODAS syndrome was first reported and named in 1991. As more patients were described, the phenotype was found to be highly variable; patients do not always present with all the aforementioned features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CODAS syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Cerebrooculodentoauriculoskeletal syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>CODAS syndrome</rdfs:label>
