        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Celiac disease, epilepsy and cerebral calcification syndrome (CEC) is a rare disorder characterized by the combination of auto-immune intestinal disease, epileptic seizures and cerebral calcifications.</obo:IAO_0000115>
