        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic syndromic intellectual disability of broad phenotypic range characterized by developmental delay and variable clinical features which most commonly, but not consistently, include aplasia or hypoplasia of the distal phalanx or nail of the fifth digit, and coarse facial features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
