        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Cerebrooculofacioskeletal (COFS) syndrome is a rare genetic disorder, belonging to a family of diseases of DNA repair, characterized by a severe sensorineural involvement.</obo:IAO_0000115>
