        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A primary bone dysplasia with micromelia characterized by rhizomelia, exaggerated lumbar lordosis, brachydactyly, and macrocephaly with frontal bossing and midface hypoplasia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
