        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Craniodiaphyseal dysplasia is a rare sclerotic bone disorder with a variable phenotypic expression with massive generalized hyperostosis and sclerosis, particularly of the skull and facial bones, that may lead to severe deformity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
