        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare disorder characterized by multiple enchondromatosis associated with multiple (dark, irregularly shaped) hemangiomas. Less commonly, lymphangiomas are also reported.</obo:IAO_0000115>
