        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare T-B+ severe combined immunodeficiency characterized by markedly decreased numbers of T-cells and normal or increased numbers of B-cells and natural killer (NK) cells. Patients generally present in infancy with recurrent infections, failure to thrive, fever, diarrhea, and dermatitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
