        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare disorder/difference of sex development (DSD) associated with a numerical sex chromosome abnormality resulting from Y-chromosome mosaicism and associated to abnormal gonadal development and features of Turner-Syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
