        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare ectodermal dysplasia syndrome that often presents with the classic triad of nail dysplasia, skin pigmentary changes, and oral leukoplakia associated with a high risk of bone marrow failure (BMF) and cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
