        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare a multisystem disorder characterized by spondyloepiphyseal dysplasia and disproportionate short stature, facial dysmorphism, T-cell immunodeficiency, and progressive, proteinuric steroid-resistant nephropathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
