        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A form of Hermansky-Pudlak syndrome (HPS) characterized by oculocutaneous albinism, bleeding diathesis, neutropenia, and in some cases, pulmonary fibrosis, neurologic involvement, or hearing loss.</obo:IAO_0000115>
