        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic isolated inherited retinal disorder characterized by primary cone degeneration with significant secondary rod involvement, with a variable fundus appearance. Typical presentation includes decreased visual acuity, central scotoma, photophobia, color vision alteration, followed by night blindness and loss of peripheral visual field.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Cone rod dystrophy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Cone rod dystrophy</rdfs:label>
