        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A genetically heterogeneous autosomal recessive syndrome characterized by the triad of amelogenesis imperfect, infantile onset epilepsy, intellectual disability with or without regression and dementia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
