        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Gaucher disease - ophthalmoplegia - cardiovascular calcification is a variant of Gaucher disease, also known as a Gaucher-like disease that is characterized by cardiac involvement.</obo:IAO_0000115>
