        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Episodic ataxia type 6 (EA6) is an exceedingly rare form of Hereditary episodic ataxia with varying degrees of ataxia and associated findings including slurred speech, headache, confusion and hemiplegia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
