        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A group of rare hereditary ataxia characterized by recurrent episodes of ataxia and vertigo which may be progressive. Weakness, dystonia and ataxia are sometimes present in the interictal period. Seven types of episodic ataxia have been described to date (type 1 to type 7), but most of the reported cases are belong to type 1 and 2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
