        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Episodic ataxia type 5 (EA5) is an extremely rare form of Hereditary episodic ataxia characterized by recurrent episodes of vertigo and ataxia lasting several hours.</obo:IAO_0000115>
