        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Hemoglobin C disease (HbC) is a hemoglobinopathy characterized by production of abnormal variant hemoglobin known as hemoglobin C, with no or mild clinical manifestations (hemolytic anemia).</obo:IAO_0000115>
