        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A lethal type of osteogenesis imperfecta (OI) characterized by increased bone fragility, low bone mass and susceptibility to bone fractures and presenting with multiple rib and long bone fractures at birth, marked deformities, broad long bones, low density skull on X-ray, and dark sclera.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Lethal osteogenesis imperfecta</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">OI type 2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
