        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A severe type form osteogenesis imperfecta characterized by increased bone fragility and low bone mass clinically manifesting as susceptibility to bone fractures, severe short stature, a triangular face, moderate to severe scoliosis, blue or blue-grey sclera, and dentinogenesis imperfecta.</obo:IAO_0000115>
