        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Xeroderma pigmentosum/Cockayne syndrome complex (XP/CS complex) is characterized by the cutaneous features of xeroderma pigmentosum (XP) together with the systemic and neurological features of Cockayne syndrome (CS).</obo:IAO_0000115>
