        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Joubert syndrome with renal defect is a rare subtype of Joubert syndrome and related disorders (JSRD) characterized by the neurological features of JS associated with renal disease, in the absence of retinopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
