        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The severe infantile form of carnitine palmitoyltransferase II (CPT II) deficiency, an inherited disorder that affects mitochondrial oxidation of long chain fatty acids (LCFA), is the early-onset form of the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
