        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The newly described 8q12 microduplication syndrome is associated with unusual and characteristic multi-organ clinical features, which include hearing loss, congenital heart defects, intellectual disability, hypotonia in infancy, and Duane anomaly.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>8q12 microduplication syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
