        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The newly described 2q23.1 microdeletion syndrome includes severe intellectual deficit with pronounced speech delay, behavioral abnormalities including hyperactivity and inappropriate laughter, short stature and seizures.</obo:IAO_0000115>
