        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Hemoglobin E - beta-thalassemia (HbE - BT) is a form of beta-thalassemia that results in a mild to severe clinical presentation ranging from a condition indistinguishable from beta-thalassemia major to a mild form of beta-thalassemia intermedia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
