        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Beta-thalassemia - X-linked thrombocytopenia is a form of beta-thalassemia characterized by splenomegaly and petechiae, moderate thrombocytopenia, prolonged bleeding time due to platelet dysfunction, reticulocytosis and mild beta-thalassemia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
