        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A form of Hermansky-Pudlak syndrome characterized by syndromic ocular or oculocutaneous albinism which may present with bleeding diathesis, and in some cases granulomatous colitis or immunodeficiency, but no pulmonary fibrosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
