        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, severe early-onset developmental epileptic encephalopathy characterized by the triad of intellectual impairment, multiple seizure types, and typical electroencephalography (EEG) abnormalities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
