        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The 15q11-q13 microduplication (dup15q11-q13) syndrome is characterized by neurobehavioral disorders, hypotonia, cognitive deficit, language delay and seizures. Prevalence is unknown.</obo:IAO_0000115>
