        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Leukoencephalopathy-palmoplantar keratoderma syndrome is a rare, genetic epidermal disease characterized by early childhood-onset of punctate palmoplantar keratoderma in association with adult-onset leukoencephalopathy manifested by progressive tetrapyramidal syndrome and cognitive deterioration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Leukoencephalopathy-palmoplantar keratoderma syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Leukoencephalopathy-palmoplantar keratoderma syndrome</rdfs:label>
