        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The 4q21 microdeletion syndrome is a newly described syndrome associated with facial dysmorphism, progressive growth restriction, severe intellectual deficit and absent or severely delayed speech.</obo:IAO_0000115>
