        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser (MRKH) syndrome type 1, a form of MRKH syndrome, is an isolated form of congenital aplasia of the uterus and 2/3 of the vagina occurring in otherwise phenotypically normal females.</obo:IAO_0000115>
