        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Melorheostosis is a rare connective tissue disorder characterized by a sclerosing bone dysplasia, usually limited to one side of the body (rarely bilateral), that manifests with pain, stiffness, joint contractures and deformities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
