        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Logopenic progressive aphasia (lv-PPA) is a form of primary progressive aphasia (PPA), characterized by impaired single-word retrieval and naming and impaired repetition with spared single-word comprehension and object knowledge.</obo:IAO_0000115>
