        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare form of autosomal dominant optic atrophy (ADOA) characterized by progressive and isolated visual loss in the first decade of life, decreased reflexes in the lower limbs and a mild cerebellar stance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
