        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">1q21.1 microdeletion syndrome is a newly described recurrent deletion syndrome with variable clinical manifestations but without the clinical picture of thrombocytopenia - absent radius (TAR) syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1q21.1 microdeletion syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
