        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Paternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 1 is an uniparental disomy of paternal origin that most likely does not have any phenotypic expression except from cases of homozygosity for a recessive disease mutation for which only father is a carrier.</obo:IAO_0000115>
