        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Linear lichen planus (LLP), also referred to as Blaschkoid LP, is a rare type of lichen planus characterized by a linear distribution of lichenoid lesions along the lines of Blaschko, which are embryonic pathways of skin development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
