        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Renal tubulopathy - encephalopathy - liver failure describes a spectrum of phenotypes with manifestations similar but milder than those seen in GRACILE syndrome and that can be associated with encephalopathy and psychiatric disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Renal tubulopathy-encephalopathy-liver failure syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Renal tubulopathy-encephalopathy-liver failure syndrome</rdfs:label>
