        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A very rare non-syndromic autosomal recessive pyridoxine-refractory sideroblastic anemia due to a splice defect of glutaredoxin-5 (&lt;i&gt;GLRX5&lt;/i&gt;) described in a single patient with adult onset microcytic hypochromic anemia with liver iron overload and type 2 diabetes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
