        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Pyruvate dehydrogenase E1-beta deficiency is an extremely rare form of pyruvate dehydrogenase deficiency (PDHD) characterized by severe lactic acidosis, developmental delay and hypotonia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
