        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Mietens syndrome is a very rare syndrome consisting of corneal opacity, nystagmus, strabismus, flexion contracture of the elbows with dislocation of the head of the radius and abnormally short ulnae and radii.</obo:IAO_0000115>
