        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Moyamoya disease (MMD) is a rare intracranial arteriopathy involving progressive stenosis of the cerebral vasculature located at the base of the brain causing transient ischemic attacks or strokes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
