        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">20p12.3 microdeletion syndrome is a recently described syndrome characterized by Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome, variable developmental delay and facial dysmorphism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>20p12.3 microdeletion syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
