        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare hereditary patellar dysostosis characterized by nail hypoplasia or aplasia, aplastic or hypoplastic patellae, elbow dysplasia, and the presence of iliac horns as well as renal and ocular anomalies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
