        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">COG1-CDG is an extremely rare form of CDG syndrome characterized clinically in the few cases reported to date by variable signs including microcephaly, growth retardation, psychomotor retardation and facial dysmorphism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
