        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Mycophenolate mofetil (MMF) embryopathy is a malformative syndrome due to the teratogenic effect of MMF, an effective immunosuppressive agent widely used for the prevention of organ rejection after organ transplantation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
