        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Behavioral variant of frontotemporal dementia (bv-FTD) is a form of frontotemporal dementia (FTD), characterized by progressive behavioral impairment and a decline in executive function with frontal lobe-predominant atrophy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
