        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Severe combined immunodeficiency (SCID) due to gamma chain deficiency, also called SCID-X1, is a form of SCID characterized by severe and recurrent infections, associated with diarrhea and failure to thrive.</obo:IAO_0000115>
