        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Multiple endocrine neoplasia type 4 (MEN4) is a very rare form of MEN, an inherited cancer syndrome, characterized by parathyroid and anterior pituitary tumors, possibly associated with adrenal, renal, and reproductive organ tumors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
