        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An autosomal dominant cerebellar ataxia type 1 that is characterized by the adult-onset of progressive gait and limb ataxia, dysarthria, ocular dysmetria, intention tremor of hands, hyperreflexia and spasmodic torticollis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
