        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An autosomal dominant cerebellar ataxia type 1 that characterized by gait and limb ataxia, lower limb spasticity, dysarthria, muscle fasiculations, tongue atrophy and hyperreflexia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
