        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Machado-Joseph disease type 1 is a rare, usually severe subtype of Machado-Joseph disease (SCA3/MJD) characterized by the presence of marked pyramidal and extrapyramidal signs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
