        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Machado-Joseph disease type 2 is a subtype of Machado-Joseph disease (SCA3/MJD) with intermediate severity characterized by an intermediate age of onset, cerebellar ataxia and external progressive ophthalmoplegia, with variable pyramidal and extrapyramidal signs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
