        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Spasmus nutans (SN) is a rare eye disease characterized by the clinical triad of asymmetric and pendular nystagmus, head nodding, and torticollis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Spasmus nutans</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
