        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare subtype of congenital pulmonary airway malformation characterized by global arrest of lung development with small, solid appearing lungs with a diffusely granular surface, histologically featuring bronchus-like structures with smooth muscle, glands, and numerous cartilage plates, embedded in loose, vascular mesenchymal tissue. The condition presents at birth and is incompatible with life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
