        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare clinical variant of epidermolytic ichthyosis (EI) characterized by the presence of a blistering phenotype at birth and the development from early infancy of annular polycyclic erythematous scales on the trunk and extremities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
