        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Small cell carcinoma of the bladder (SCCB) is a very rare, poorly differentiated neuroendocrine epithelial bladder tumor characterized clinically by hematuria and/or dysuria and a highly aggressive course.</obo:IAO_0000115>
