        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, genetic, rheumatologic disease characterized by congenital or early-onset camptodactyly and symmetrical, polyarticular, non-inflammatory, large joint arthropathy with synovial hyperplasia, as well as progressive coxa vara deformity and, occasionally, non-inflammatory pericarditis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
