        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare motor neuron disease characterized by onset before 25 years of age of progressive upper and/or lower motor neuron degeneration, leading to bulbar and limb motor impairment, with marked clinical and genetic heterogeneity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
