        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Pyruvate carboxylase (PC) deficiency is a rare neurometabolic disorder characterized by metabolic acidosis, failure to thrive, developmental delay, and recurrent seizures at an early age in severely affected patients.</obo:IAO_0000115>
