        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, biliary tract disease characterized by progressive obliterative cholangiopathy of the intra- and extrahepatic bile ducts, occuring in the embryonic/ perinatal period, leading to severe and persistent neonatal jaundice and acholic stool.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Isolated atresia of bile ducts</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
