        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A group of hereditary epidermolysis bullosa (HEB) disorders characterized by skin fragility resulting in intraepidermal blisters and erosions that occur either spontaneously or after physical trauma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
