        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, mixed, functioning pituitary adenoma characterized by the cosecretion of growth hormone and prolactin, which manifests with signs and symptoms of both acromegaly and hyperprolactinemia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">GH and PRL cosecreting pituitary adenoma</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
