        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Sézary syndrome (SS) is an aggressive form of cutaneous T-cell lymphoma characterized by a triad of erythroderma, lymphadenopathy and circulating atypical lymphocytes (Sézary cells).</obo:IAO_0000115>
