        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Combined immunodeficiency (CID) due to &lt;i&gt;STIM1&lt;/i&gt; deficiency is a form of CID due to Calcium release activated Ca2+(CRAC) channel dysfunction characterized by recurrent infections, autoimmunity, congenital myopathy and ectodermal dysplasia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
