        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare neurological disorder comprising fluctuating trunk and limb stiffness, painful muscle spasms, task-specific phobia related to walking, an exaggerated startle response, and often ankylosing deformities such as fixed lumbar hyperlordosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
