        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare medullar disease characterized by cerebrospinal fluid (CSF)-filled cavities (syrinx) inside the spinal cord as a result of an obstruction to CSF flow, either at the craniovertebral junction (Chiari malformation) or in the perimedullary subarachnoid spaces (arachnoiditis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
