        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare inherited bleeding disorder characterized by reduced levels and/or activity of factor XI (FXI) resulting in moderate bleeding symptoms, usually occurring after trauma or surgery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
