        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Tel Hashomer camptodactyly syndrome is a rare syndrome characterized by camptodactyly, muscle hypoplasia and weakness, skeletal anomalies, facial dysmorphism and abnormal dermatoglyphics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Camptodactyly-muscular hypoplasia-skeletal anomalies-abnormal palmar creases syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Tel Hashomer camptodactyly syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
