        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A syndromic genetic deafness characterized by erythrokeratoderma, hypotrichosis, nail dystrophy and sensorineural hearing loss. Erythema, recurrent skin infections and mucositis have also been associated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hypotrichosis-deafness syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
