        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare form of agammaglobulinemia, a primary immunodeficiency disease, and is characterized by variable immune dysfunction with frequent and recurrent bacterial infections and/or chronic diarrhea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
