        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare congenital malformation syndrome characterized by bilateral absence/hypoplasia of the radii with presence of both thumbs, and thrombocytopenia. Additional manifestations can include cow&apos;s milk allergy, anomalies of the lower limbs, heart and genitourinary system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
