        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare neurologic disease characterized by an excessive daytime sleepiness with long and unrefreshing naps, and/or prolonged and undisturbed nocturnal sleep, impaired daytime alertness, and/or sleep inertia (ie, great difficulty in waking up after sleep) and where other causes have been excluded.</obo:IAO_0000115>
