        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, genetic, syndromic hair shaft abnormality disorder characterized by short, dry, sulfur-deficient, brittle hair usually associated with highly variable neuroectodermal manifestations, such as ichthyosis, photosensitivity, and intellectual disability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
