        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare congenital respiratory disorder characterized by marked dilatation of the trachea and proximal bronchi that leads to impaired airway secretion clearance and recurrent lower respiratory tract infections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
