        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare disorder of tyrosine metabolism characterized by tyrosinemia, moderate hyperphenylalaninemia, and tyrosiluria that usually resolve after 2 months of age. It shows no clinical symptoms and is detected upon newborn screening. It is often observed in premature infants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
