        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic multiple congenital anomalies characterized by deafness and defects in neural crest-derived structures, including pigmentation anomalies of the eyes, hair, and skin. Four clinical phenotypes are associated with the term &apos;&apos;Waardenburg syndrome&apos;&apos; (WS).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Waardenburg syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
