        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare chronic infectious disorder in which almost all organ systems can be invaded by the rod-shaped bacterium Tropheryma whipplei (&lt;i&gt;TW&lt;/i&gt;).</obo:IAO_0000115>
