        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare X-linked genetic condition due to deficiency of the lysosomal-associated membrane protein 2 (LAMP2) characterized by severe cardiomyopathy and variable degrees of muscle weakness, frequently associated with intellectual deficits (in males).</obo:IAO_0000115>
