        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic multiple congenital anomalies syndrome characterized by gingival fibromatosis, coarse facial appearance, and absence or hypoplasia of nails or terminal phalanges of hands and feet.</obo:IAO_0000115>
