        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">CHIME syndrome is a rare ectodermal dysplasia syndrome characterized by ocular colobomas, cardiac defects, ichthyosiform dermatosis, intellectual disability, conductive hearing loss and epilepsy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
