        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Fructose-1,6-biphosphatase (FBP) deficiency is a disorder of fructose metabolism characterized by recurrent episodes of fasting hypoglycemia with lactic acidosis, that may be life-threatening in neonates and infants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
