            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare lysosomal storage disease characterized by widespread tissue buildup of glycolipids and oligosaccharides rich in fucose. Patients present with broad clinical characteristics such as intellectual disability, developmental delay associated with psychomotor regression and bone abnormalities, visceromegaly, hyperhidrosis, and dermatological abnormalities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Alpha-L-fucosidase deficiency</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
