        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare viral disease characterized by fulminant cytomegalovirus infection with multiple organ involvement including the brain, lung, liver, and/or heart, among others, and marked constitutional symptoms in immunocompetent patients. The condition is associated with a high case fatality rate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Severe disseminated CMV infection in immunocompetent patients</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Severe disseminated cytomegalovirus infection in immunocompetent patients</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
