        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Desmosterolosis is a very rare sterol biosynthesis disorder characterized by multiple congenital anomalies, failure to thrive, and intellectual disability, with elevated levels of desmosterol.</obo:IAO_0000115>
