        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare lysosomal disease characterized by intermittent vomiting, hypotonia, lethargy, opisthotonos, and fatal outcome in early infancy, associated with deficient acid phosphatase in lysosomes. There have been no further descriptions in the literature since 1970.</obo:IAO_0000115>
