        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Infantile pyruvate carboxylase (PC) deficiency (Type A) is a rare, severe form of PC deficiency characterized by infantile-onset, mild to moderate lactic acidemia, and a generally severe course.</obo:IAO_0000115>
