        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Severe neonatal pyruvate carboxylase (PC) deficiency (Type B) is a rare, extremely severe form of PC deficiency characterized by severe, early-onset metabolic acidosis, and a generally fatal outcome in early infancy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
