        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">GM1 gangliosidosis is a rare lysosomal storage disorder characterized biochemically by deficient beta-galactosidase activity and clinically by a wide range of variable neurovisceral, ophthalmological and dysmorphic features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
