        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare polymalformative syndrome characterized by agenesis of corpus callosum (CC), distal anomalies of limbs, minor craniofacial anomalies and intellectual disability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
