        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, syndromic ichthyosis characterized by a collodion membrane at birth, generalized congenital ichthyosis, microspherophakia, myopia, ectopia lentis, short stature with brachydactyly and joint stiffness, and occasionally mitral valve dysplasia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">15q26.3 microdeletion syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Ichthyosis-short stature-brachydactyly-microspherophakia syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
