        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A frequent form of Hereditary episodic ataxia characterized by brief episodes of ataxia, neuromyotonia, and continuous interictal myokymia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
