        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Juvenile myasthenia gravis (MG) is a rare form of MG, an autoimmune disorder of the neuromuscular junction resulting in ocular manifestations or generalized weakness, with onset before 18 years of age.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Childhood myasthenia gravis</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
