        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Glycine encephalopathy (GE) is an inborn error of glycine metabolism characterized by accumulation of glycine in body fluids and tissues, including the brain, resulting in neurometabolic symptoms of variable severity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
