        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, congenital renal tract malformation characterized by the complete absence of development of one or both kidneys (unilateral or bilateral renal agenesis respectively), accompanied by absent ureter(s).</obo:IAO_0000115>
