        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A group of rare inherited endocrine disorders caused by a steroidogenic enzyme deficiency and characterized by adrenal insufficiency and variable degrees of hyper- or hypoandrogenism manifestations, depending on disease type and severity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
