        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, genetic, primary immunodeficiency disorder characterized by increased radiosensitivity(R), mild immunodeficiency (ID), dysmorphic features (D), and learning difficulties (LE).</obo:IAO_0000115>
