        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Tietz syndrome is a genetic hypopigmentation and deafness syndrome characterized by congenital profound bilateral sensorineural hearing loss and generalized albino-like hypopigmentation of skin, eyes and hair.</obo:IAO_0000115>
