        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare progressive peroxisomal disorder characterized by endocrine dysfunction (adrenal failure and sometimes testicular insufficiency), progressive myelopathy, peripheral neuropathy and, variably, progressive leukodystrophy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
