        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">PDE4D haploinsufficiency syndrome is a rare syndromic intellectual disability characterized by developmental delay, intellectual disability, low body mass index, long arms, fingers and toes, prominent nose and small chin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
