        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic skin disease belonging to the Mendelian Disorders of Cornification (MeDOC) and characterized by generalized hyperkeratosis and scaling of the skin. The condition is rather mild.</obo:IAO_0000115>
