        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare inflammatory neutrophilic dermatosis characterized by painful cutaneous ulcerations with a violaceous and undermined border affecting the lower extremities; however, any hair-bearing area can be affected.</obo:IAO_0000115>
