        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A form of portosinusoidal vascular disease characterized histologically by the absence of cirrhosis and diffuse benign transformation of the hepatic parenchyma into multiple small nodules (typically 1-3 mm).</obo:IAO_0000115>
