        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A group of rare disorders with irreversible organ and/or system dysfunction(s), or the effects of dysfunction after alternative medical and surgical treatments have been utilized, for which the benefits of transplantation outweigh the risk of continuing alternative modalities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
