        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare inherited subacute encephalopathy characterized by the variable association of basal ganglia calcification, leukodystrophy, cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) lymphocytosis and evidence of enhanced type I interferon signaling in blood and CSF.</obo:IAO_0000115>
