        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare X-linked syndromic intellectual disability characterized by clinical manifestations commencing with early childhood onset hearing loss, followed by adolescent onset progressive dystonia or ataxia, visual impairment from early adulthood onwards and dementia from the 4th decade onwards.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">DDON syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Deafness-dystonia-optic neuronopathy syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
