        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, inherited, cancer predisposition syndrome characterized by the early-onset of multiple primary cancers including breast cancer, soft tissue and bone sarcomas, brain tumors, adrenal cortical carcinoma (ACC), leukemias, and other cancers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
