        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Mantle cell lymphoma is a rare form of malignant non-Hodgkin lymphoma affecting B lymphocytes in the lymph nodes in a region called the ``mantle zone&apos;&apos;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
