        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic developmental and epileptic encephalopathy (DEE) characterized by developmental delay, generalized epilepsy consisting of eyelid myoclonia with absences and myoclonic-atonic seizures, intellectual disability and autism spectrum disorder (ASD).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">SYNGAP1-related DEE</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
