        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare group of inherited neuromuscular disorders characterized by clinical features of a congenital myopathy and centrally placed nuclei on muscle biopsy. The clinical picture and other histologic features varies according to gene involved and mode of inheritance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
