        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Loeys-Dietz syndrome is a rare genetic connective tissue disorder characterized by a broad spectrum of craniofacial, vascular and skeletal manifestations with four genetic subtypes described forming a clinical continuum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
