        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Tibial muscular dystrophy (TMD) is a distal myopathy characterized by weakness of the muscles of the anterior compartment of lower limbs, appearing in the fourth to seventh decade of life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
