        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare ophthalmic disorder characterized by periodic inflammatory attacks of the cornea manifesting as unilateral ocular pain, conjunctival hyperemia, photophobia and epiphora lasting for 1 to 3 days, followed by blurred vision for several weeks.</obo:IAO_0000115>
