        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare neurologic disease with psychiatric involvement characterized by a cluster of signs and symptoms of catatonia that is not associated with any underlying psychiatric or organic disorder or intoxication.</obo:IAO_0000115>
