        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by abnormal retinal development with congenital blindness. Common associated manifestations include sensorineural hearing loss and developmental delay, intellectual disability and/or behavioral disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
