        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare hematological disorder characterized by moderate to severe thrombocytopenia with hemorrhages with or without the presence of mild to severe anemia. The disease affects almost exclusively males.</obo:IAO_0000115>
