        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">3-methylglutaconic aciduria type III (MGA III) is an organic aciduria characterised by the association of optic atrophy and choreoathetosis with 3-methylglutaconic aciduria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
