        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Papillon-Lefèvre syndrome (PLS) is a rare ectodermal dysplasia characterized by palmoplantar keratoderma associated with early-onset periodontitis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
