        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare inborn error of tyrosine metabolism characterized by mild hypertyrosinemia and increased urinary excretion of 4-hydroxyphenylpyruvate, 4-hydroxyphenyllactate and 4-hydroxyphenylacetate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
