        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A group of rare fast-flow arteriovenous malformation characterized by variable appearance and symptoms, located in the head and neck region, the limbs, the chest and the trunk. The group includes both arteriovenous malformations and arteriovenous fistulas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
