        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare fast-flow vascular anomaly located within a muscle characterized by the lesions that are usually well-defined and contain smaller vessels without or with only little obvious arteriovenous shunting on imaging. This anomaly is usually associated with pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
