        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Chylomicron retention disease (CRD) is a type of familial hypocholesterolemia characterized by malnutrition, failure to thrive, growth failure, vitamin E deficiency and hepatic, neurologic and ophthalmologic complications.</obo:IAO_0000115>
