            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Split hand - split foot - deafness is an extremely rare genetic syndrome reported in a few families to date and characterized clinically by split hand/split foot malformation (SHFM) and mild to moderate sensorineural hearing loss, sometimes associated with cleft palate and intellectual deficit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Split hand-split foot-deafness syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
