        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic cardiac disease characterized by restrictive ventricular filling due to high ventricular stiffness that results in severe diastolic dysfunction in the absence of dilated or hypertrophied ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
