        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Gaucher disease type 3 is the subacute neurological form of Gaucher disease (GD) characterized by progressive encephalopathy and associated with the systemic manifestations (organomegaly, bone involvement, cytopenia) of GD type 1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
