        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare, autosomal recessive, acid sphingomyelinase deficiency characterized clinically by onset in infancy or early childhood with failure to thrive, hepatosplenomegaly, interstitial lung disease and rapidly progressive neurodegenerative disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
