        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Retinitis pigmentosa (RP) is an inherited retinal dystrophy leading to progressive loss of the photoreceptors and retinal pigment epithelium and resulting in blindness usually after several decades.</obo:IAO_0000115>
