        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare autoimmune encephalitis/neuropathy characterized by disturbances of consciousness, ophthalmoplegia, ataxia, and hyperreflexia. It has common clinical features with Miller Fisher syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
