        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic disorder of galactose metabolism characterized by onset of life-threatening disease triggered by breastfeeding or the ingestion of lactose/galactose-containing formula. Infants usually develop feeding difficulties, lethargy, and severe liver disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
