        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Congenital bile acid synthesis defect type 1 (BAS defect type 1) is the most common anomaly of bile acid synthesis characterized by variable manifestations of progressive cholestatic liver disease, and fat malabsorption.</obo:IAO_0000115>
