        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Congenital bile acid synthesis defect type 2 (BAS defect type 2) is an anomaly of bile acid synthesis characterized by severe and rapidly progressive cholestatic liver disease, and malabsorption of fat and fat-soluble vitamins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
