        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">PFIC1, a type of progressive familial intrahepathic cholestasis (PFIC), is an infantile hereditary disorder in bile formation that is hepatocellular in origin and associated with extrahepatic features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
