        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Maculopapular cutaneous mastocytosis (MCM) is a form of cutaneous mastocytosis (CM) characterized by the presence of multiple hyperpigmented macules, papules or nodules associated with abnormal accumulation of mast cells in the skin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
