        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare multiple congenital anomalies-intellectual disability syndrome characterized by sensorineural hearing loss (deafness), onychodystrophy, osteodystrophy, mild to profound intellectual disability, and seizures.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Autosomal recessive deafness-onychodystrophy syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
