        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Ichthyosis hystrix of Curth-Macklin (IHCM) is a rare type of keratinopathic ichthyosis that is characterized by the presence of severe hyperkeratotic lesions and palmoplantar keratoderma (PPK).</obo:IAO_0000115>
