        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Leukotriene C4 synthase deficiency is an extremely rare fatal neurometabolic developmental disorder characterized clinically by muscular hypotonia, psychomotor retardation, failure to thrive, and microcephaly.</obo:IAO_0000115>
