        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare neurodegenerative disease characterized by progressive muscular paralysis reflecting degeneration of motor neurons in the primary motor cortex, corticospinal tracts, brainstem and spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
