        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare gastroenterologic disease manifesting as intractable diarrhea in the first month of life with failure to thrive and associated with facial dysmorphism, hair abnormalities, and, in some cases, immune disorders and intrauterine growth restriction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
