        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Hereditary thermosensitive neuropathy is a rare, demyelinating, hereditary motor and sensory neuropathy characterized by reversible episodes of ascending muscle weakness, paresthesias and areflexia triggered by a febrile episode, with or without pressure palsy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hereditary thermosensitive neuropathy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
