        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Glanzmann thrombasthenia (GT) is a bleeding syndrome characterized by spontaneous mucocutaneous bleeding and an exaggerated response to trauma due to a constitutional thrombocytopenia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
