        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Triosephosphate isomerase (TPI) deficiency is a severe autosomal recessive inherited multisystem disorder of glycolytic metabolism characterized by hemolytic anemia and neurodegeneration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
