        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare inborn error of tyrosine catabolism characterized by progressive liver disease, renal tubular dysfunction, porphyria-like crises and a dramatic improvement in prognosis following treatment with nitisinone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
