        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_557493"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic odontal or periodontal disorder that represents a group of developmental conditions affecting the structure and clinical appearance of the enamel of all or nearly all the teeth in a more or less equal manner, and which may be associated with morphologic or biochemical changes elsewhere in the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
