        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Wagner disease is a rare hereditary vitreoretinopathy characterized by an anomaleous vitreous associated with myopia, cataract, chorioretinal atrophy, and peripheral tractional or rhegmatogenous retinal detachment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
