        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare anti-neutrophil cytoplasmic antibodies (ANCA)-associated vasculitis characterized by necrotizing inflammation of small and medium vessels (capillaries, venules and arterioles), resulting in tissue ischemia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
