        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">X-linked cone dysfunction syndrome with myopia is characterised by moderate to high myopia associated with astigmatism and deuteranopia. Less than 10 families have been described so far. Transmission is X-linked recessive and the locus has been mapped to Xq28.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Bornholm eye disease</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>X-linked cone dysfunction syndrome with myopia</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
