        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Simple (monoclonal) cryoglobulinemia or type I cryoglobulinemia refers to the presence in the serum of one isotype or subclass of immunoglobulin (Ig) that precipitates reversibly below 37°C.</obo:IAO_0000115>
