        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A congenital renal malformation characterized by abnormally small kidney(s) (kidney volume below two standard deviations of that of age-matched normal individuals or a combined kidney volume of less than half of what is normal for the patient&apos;s age) with normal corticomedullary differentiation and reduced number of nephrons.</obo:IAO_0000115>
