        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare genetic renal tubular disease, characterized by manifestations of proximal tubule dysfunction with low-molecular-weight (LMW) proteinuria, hypercalciuria, nephrolithiasis, nephrocalcinosis, and progressive renal failure. Extra-renal involvement is frequent, but may be mild and not recognized.</obo:IAO_0000115>
