        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A severe form of holoprosencephaly characterized by a single brain ventricle and no interhemispheric fissure. Severe craniofacial features may manifest as cyclopia, ethmocephaly or cebocephaly.</obo:IAO_0000115>
