        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A subtype of exstrophy-epispadias complex (EEC) characterized in males by an open urethra on the dorsum of the penis and in females by a bifid clitoris and variable cleft of the urethra.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Isolated epispadias</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Isolated epispadias</rdfs:label>
