        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A congenital malformation of the external ear and the most extreme form of microtia characterized by the complete absence of the external ear and auditory canal, conductive hearing loss, attention deficit disorders and delayed language development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
