        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Maternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 9 is a uniparental disomy of maternal origin that most likely does not have any phenotypic expression except from cases of homozygosity for a recessive disease mutation for which only mother is a carrier.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Maternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 9 syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
