        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare lethal form of multicystic dysplastic kidney (MCDK), a congenital anomaly of the kidney and urinary tract (CAKUT), in which both kidneys are large, distended by non-communicating multiple cysts and non-functional.</obo:IAO_0000115>
