        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Combined vitamin K-dependent clotting factors deficiency (VKCFD) is a congenital bleeding disorder resulting from variably decreased levels of coagulation factors II, VII, IX and X, as well as natural anticoagulants protein C, protein S and protein Z.</obo:IAO_0000115>
