        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rare seizure disorder characterized by intermittent dystonia and/or choreoathetoid movements that occur during sleep. The clusters of nocturnal motor seizures are often stereotyped and brief.</obo:IAO_0000115>
