        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Paroxysmal exertion-induced dyskinesia (PED) is a form of paroxysmal dyskinesia, characterized by painless attacks of dystonia of the extremities triggered by prolonged physical activities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
