            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An advanced form of systemic mastocytosis (SM) characterized by the abnormal accumulation of neoplastic mast cells (MCs) in one or more extracutaneous organs, mainly the bone marrow, associated with another hematologic neoplasm of non MC nature.</obo:IAO_0000115>
