        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Subepithelial mucinous corneal dystrophy (SMCD) is a very rare form of superficial corneal dystrophy characterized by frequent recurrent corneal erosions in the first decade of life, with progressive loss of vision.</obo:IAO_0000115>
