        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Paternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 13 is an uniparental disomy of paternal origin that most likely does not have any phenotypic expression except from cases of homozygosity for a recessive disease mutation for which only father is a carrier.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Paternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 13 syndrome</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">UPD(13)pat</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Paternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 13 syndrome</rdfs:label>
