        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Typhoid or typhoid fever is a reportable, fecal-oral, potentially fatal infectious disease, caused by the bacteria &lt;i&gt;Salmonella typhi&lt;/i&gt; and characterized by a non-focal fever.</obo:IAO_0000115>
