        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Pontiac fever (PF) is a mild form of legionellosis manifesting with flu-like symptoms such as nausea, myalgia, fever, cough and headache but without pneumonia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">Non-pneumonic Legionnaires&apos; disease</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
