        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Haddad syndrome is a rare congenital disorder in which congenital central hypoventilation syndrome (CCHS), or Ondine syndrome, occurs concurrently with Hirschsprung disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
