        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Nipah virus disease, caused by the Nipah virus, is a recently discovered zoonotic disease characterized by fever, constitutional symptoms and encephalitis, sometimes accompanied by respiratory illness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
