        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_69078"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Well-differentiated liposarcoma (WDLS), the most common type of liposarcoma (LS), is a slow growing, painless tumor usually located in the retroperitoneum or the limbs. It is composed of proliferating mature adipocytes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
